1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:00,920
Hi, Blaine.

2
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:02,080
This is Samantha.

3
00:00:02,780 --> 00:00:08,605
I just received word that we've hired some new employees, so we need to prepare uniforms for each of them.

4
00:00:08,920 --> 00:00:14,750
As you know, the uniform consists of a shirt, a jacket, a pair of pants, and a pair of shoes.

5
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:18,120
We've got eight employees who will be starting next week.

6
00:00:18,380 --> 00:00:21,380
Please check to make sure that we have enough of each item.

7
00:00:21,860 --> 00:00:26,220
If we don't, go ahead and order whatever we need from our regular supplier.

8
00:00:26,820 --> 00:00:30,680
Then, have the items delivered to me no later than Monday morning.

9
00:00:31,260 --> 00:00:33,805
If you've got any questions, please let me know.
